	(text "I2C on A4/A5 with 4.7k pull-ups to bus +5V (R1, R2). XRST (D4, R3 pull-up) holds the expanders reset while the bus\nhas no power, sensed on A0 through R4/R5. D2/D3 take the expanders' INTA. J2: SPARE1-4, +5V, GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8ba7c289-027f-5edd-bc08-e452328c909b"))
